From c6e418e6af5d749c3cdd1705e500d87f2a88589b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:44:18 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 04/27] phy: samsung-ufs: Add Exynos9810 UFS PHY support (WIP)

Add PMA tables for the Exynos9810 embedded combo PHY, taken from
Samsung's ufs-cal-9810.c (byte offsets, 0x140 byte lane stride), the PMU
isolation control at 0x724, a 200 us settle after init and the CDR AFC
lock wait used after HS power mode changes.

Work in progress: link startup does not succeed yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/phy/samsung/Makefile             |   1 +
 drivers/phy/samsung/phy-exynos9810-ufs.c | 117 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.c    |   5 +
 drivers/phy/samsung/phy-samsung-ufs.h    |   1 +
 4 files changed, 124 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/phy/samsung/phy-exynos9810-ufs.c

